Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.25,0:00:06.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,As we came out of the dark tunnel, we saw...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.63,0:00:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yay, the ocean!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.25,0:00:12.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Photoshoot time!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.58,0:00:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa, and there are like, no people here!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.04,0:00:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not many people know about it.\NEri and I used it a lot for cosplay shoots.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.88,0:00:21.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the beach!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:21.33,0:00:23.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wanna get Nonopi out to the beach.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.54,0:00:27.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Otaku don't like going to the beach.\NRight, Ririsa-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.08,0:00:30.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,The beach is a great idea!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.13,0:00:31.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yes, a great idea indeed.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,The contrast of our skin\Nagainst the brilliant blue!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.58,0:00:37.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Dramatic sunlight! Infinite shot angles!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.25,0:00:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the perfect place for a shoot!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.13,0:00:41.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every cosplayer wants to\Nget pictures on the beach!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:41.63,0:00:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,And with Obon season over,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:43.17,0:00:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,and beach season dying down,\Nnow's the perfect time.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.96,0:00:47.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jellyfish season is cosplay season!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.75,0:00:49.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Jellyfish season?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.42,0:00:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.38,0:00:51.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're thinking an overnight trip, right, Kisaki-san?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.67,0:00:52.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're thinking an overnight trip, right, Kisaki-san?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:51.67,0:00:52.29,Q1,,0,0,0,,An overnighter?!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.29,0:00:53.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're thinking an overnight trip, right, Kisaki-san?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:53.79,0:00:55.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah! That's the idea!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:56.79,0:00:59.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well, if it's for cosplay...
Dialogue: 1,0:00:59.67,0:01:01.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,A summer training camp trip, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:02.25,0:01:06.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Every sports anime has that episode.\NDamn, this is totally gonna make us power up.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.04,0:01:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,So we are treating cosplay as a sport. Thought so.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.92,0:01:11.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,A sleepover with Senpai. A sleepover with Senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.00,0:01:12.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,A sleepover with Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:12.83,0:01:16.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, my modeling contract says no swimsuits,
Dialogue: 1,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,but I'll wear one just for you.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.54,0:01:22.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cool, can't wait.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:22.63,0:01:25.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I already know you don't really care!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a second, does Mikarin...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,...have a crush on Okumura?
Dialogue: 1,0:01:30.71,0:01:39.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,No way. She's a famous fashion model!\NWhy would she want a weirdo otaku like...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:39.92,0:01:42.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,The manga you made, the manga you created...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.63,0:01:45.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like him...
Dialogue: 1,0:01:52.25,0:01:57.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Man, sometimes, 3D girls act so weird\NI can't even tell what they're thinking.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:35.83,0:03:37.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Girls in swimsuits...
Dialogue: 1,0:03:37.83,0:03:41.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I couldn't care less... But I have to, for the art!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:41.67,0:03:44.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Cosplay isn't 2D or 3D.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:44.75,0:03:46.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,At best, it's 2.5D, right in the middle.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:47.71,0:03:57.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,They call Erika the closest thing to 2D,\Nbut in my eyes, she's perfectly 2.5D.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:57.54,0:04:02.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Photos are 2D, and you can use editing\Nmagic to make them look even more 2D.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:02.96,0:04:04.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe what you're missing is that
Dialogue: 1,0:04:04.58,0:04:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,awareness that your cosplayer is a living,\Nbreathing person.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.67,0:04:10.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to see them as a person?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:10.46,0:04:14.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,As long as you see Ririsa as a life-size figurine,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:14.08,0:04:16.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,you'll never get a picture of a living, breathing Liliel.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:19.79,0:04:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,So, I'll never get good photos unless\NI develop some kind of interest in 3D girls?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:32.21,0:04:34.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what do you think?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.08,0:04:39.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know you couldn't wait to see,\Nso I'm a little nervous to...
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.79,0:04:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai?!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.29,0:04:44.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, show some interest, Okumura!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:44.54,0:04:48.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I want to get lifelike cosplay pictures,\NI need to change my mindset!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:48.50,0:04:50.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,3D girls aren't figurines!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:50.92,0:04:53.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,I-it's okay. I shouldn't have expected you to care.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:54.21,0:04:55.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You look great, Mikari.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:58.50,0:05:03.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,After all that, did Senpai just say\NI looked good out of cosplay?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:04.79,0:05:06.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari?! Don't die on me!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:06.25,0:05:07.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I mess that up?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:07.38,0:05:10.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, don't get ahead of us here, guys!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:10.88,0:05:13.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikarin! Okumura!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:15.79,0:05:17.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I bought this just for today!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:18.33,0:05:20.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Though not like you would care that much, Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:22.00,0:05:26.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, you look great.\NThat color matches your bright personality.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:27.50,0:05:30.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks. I'm glad I went for yellow.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:30.79,0:05:35.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's that come from?\NWhat happened to him not caring?!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.29,0:05:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I do that right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.83,0:05:41.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sounds like you're taking my advice to heart, Okamura.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:41.00,0:05:42.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go on, tell me how I look!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:42.92,0:05:44.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't need to.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:44.13,0:05:47.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey! Most guys would be thrilled to see their\N22-year-old teacher in a tight swimsuit!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:47.54,0:05:49.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wonder what Ririsa's gonna wear.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.58,0:05:52.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, shoot, I should've given her advice.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:54.25,0:05:56.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Bet it'll be a disaster.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:56.29,0:05:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry that took so long!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:03.46,0:06:07.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I just couldn't get my hair right...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.29,0:06:11.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ririsa, the photoshoot's tomorrow.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, it is?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.17,0:06:14.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'll go take my wig and wings off!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:14.92,0:06:16.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, don't go into the light!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:21.00,0:06:22.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry about that!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:23.42,0:06:24.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.33,0:06:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd my heart leap into my throat?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.96,0:06:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd my heart leap into my throat?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.96,0:06:29.96,Q1,,0,0,0,,Senpai?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:29.96,0:06:30.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd my heart leap into my throat?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:31.08,0:06:34.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-yeah, Ririsa, you look cu...
Dialogue: 1,0:06:35.25,0:06:37.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-s-s-s-senpai, let's go!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.42,0:06:38.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan?!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:38.67,0:06:39.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:41.58,0:06:42.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,And this!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,What're you waiting for, Okumura!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.00,0:06:48.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:52.29,0:06:55.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,S-senpai, do you, uh... Work out?
Dialogue: 1,0:06:55.79,0:06:58.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, all otaku work out.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:59.08,0:07:01.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,We do the One Punch Man routine,\Nthen the HxH punches of gratitude.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:01.75,0:07:03.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure no one actually does those.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:05.46,0:07:06.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Where's Nonoa?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:07.54,0:07:11.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nono-pi, come play with us!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.63,0:07:16.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's so fun about splashing\Nwater or throwing a ball?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:16.75,0:07:17.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:19.33,0:07:21.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,You should go be with them.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:21.29,0:07:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-senpai... Sure, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:07:24.29,0:07:28.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason why they like it so much.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:28.96,0:07:32.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why don't you go over there and\Nsee if you can find out why?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:32.29,0:07:34.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess I could.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.88,0:07:38.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That feels nice.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:38.17,0:07:39.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:40.58,0:07:41.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:41.96,0:07:43.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:43.04,0:07:44.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Tossin' the ball around!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:44.25,0:07:45.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,The ball's not even here right now!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:46.13,0:07:48.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Isn't this fun?!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:48.13,0:07:51.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Your extrovert energy is kinda intimidating!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:52.33,0:07:56.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,But yeah, the water feels nice,
Dialogue: 1,0:07:56.33,0:08:03.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,and seeing you guys having so much\Nfun is kinda rubbing off on me, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:03.42,0:08:05.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not like coming here\Nmade a difference, though...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:06.63,0:08:07.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nono-pi!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:07.46,0:08:08.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're so cute when you're being tsundere!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.00,0:08:13.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, the lodge owner gave us a watermelon!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:13.88,0:08:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's bust it open!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:15.00,0:08:16.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, three melons.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:16.75,0:08:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go for it, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:18.33,0:08:20.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's more to the right! Wait, the left!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:20.75,0:08:23.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Up, up, down, down, left, right, left, right, B, A!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:23.67,0:08:25.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't confuse me with random cheat codes!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.54,0:08:29.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Nonoa-chan!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:30.33,0:08:31.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.88,0:08:36.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm not a big fan of watermelon.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:36.71,0:08:40.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of cucumbers and\Nhow it's not really that sweet.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:40.29,0:08:43.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Plus it's gross that it's red on the inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:43.58,0:08:45.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did a watermelon kill your parents or something?
Dialogue: 1,0:08:45.96,0:08:47.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.92,0:08:50.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,It definitely tastes better with friends.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:52.96,0:08:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go right! Now left!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:55.33,0:08:58.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,This isn't how the watermelon game is supposed to work!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:58.29,0:08:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Careful, don't let that otaku fool you!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Careful, don't let that otaku fool you!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:59.21,0:09:00.83,Q1,,0,0,0,,Got any trash?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:00.83,0:09:03.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:04.96,0:09:08.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura-senpai, you're kinda like a superhero.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, me?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.88,0:09:14.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Usually when people talk to me,
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.17,0:09:19.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,they want something out of it,\Nor just want to talk about themselves.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:19.92,0:09:24.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Most people don't bother asking me what I think,\Nor trying to help me.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:25.25,0:09:28.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're the first person who did, Okumura-senpai.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:29.63,0:09:32.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry, was it too much?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:32.67,0:09:33.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:34.21,0:09:39.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I just feel like you truly see me,\Nin every sense of the word.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.13,0:09:40.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,And that makes me happy.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:41.04,0:09:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,It makes me want to spend more time with you.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.63,0:09:44.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,It does?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.58,0:09:50.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,She thinks I truly see her?\NWhat makes her feel that way, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:51.63,0:09:53.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's how I make you feel?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:53.17,0:09:53.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:56.50,0:09:57.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,That smile.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.88,0:10:01.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,If I had my camera right now,\Nthis would make a fantastic picture!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why'd I think that, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:03.17,0:10:05.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I really just think a 3D girl was cute?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:05.88,0:10:08.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it. I just need to puzzle this out.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.17,0:10:12.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Nonoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:14.04,0:10:15.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna take some great pictures tomorrow!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:18.25,0:10:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait a second...
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.79,0:10:25.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did I just improve my social link\Nwith Okumura-senpai?!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:25.33,0:10:27.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe this'll unlock a new ending!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:27.75,0:10:30.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't think I have to worry about Nonoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:31.54,0:10:35.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ohmigosh, we should totally go on\Na night walk somewhere spooky!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:35.71,0:10:37.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Ooh, that'd be fun!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:37.46,0:10:39.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's such a cliché.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:39.17,0:10:41.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,The perfect chance to glom onto Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:41.54,0:10:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Trespassing onto private property\Nwithout just cause is illegal.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:47.75,0:10:50.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,As your club president,\Nit's my duty to keep us on the right side of the law!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:50.38,0:10:51.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's okay, actually.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:51.75,0:10:54.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,The town tourism board has a legal option.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:56.50,0:10:59.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Aria, are you scared of ghosts?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:00.50,0:11:03.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're like the number one thing that scares me!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:07.29,0:11:09.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I saw something! I totally saw something!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:10.71,0:11:12.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's just a spirit floating around.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:12.04,0:11:14.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're supposed to say,\N'Don't worry, it's nothing!'
Dialogue: 1,0:11:16.38,0:11:17.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:18.21,0:11:19.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:19.42,0:11:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,He doesn't see me that way.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.04,0:11:23.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I feel like an idiot for getting embarrassed.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:23.42,0:11:25.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, Aria's usually so strong and confident.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:25.71,0:11:26.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,W-what?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:27.21,0:11:28.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,She needs my help.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. I'm here if you need me.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:33.50,0:11:34.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:36.08,0:11:38.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, well I need you, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:11:38.88,0:11:40.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,How is he so good at this?
Dialogue: 1,0:11:41.71,0:11:44.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Did you see her?\NShe nearly leaped out of her skin!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.71,0:11:49.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,But the guy with her doesn't\Nseem affected in the slightest.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:49.04,0:11:52.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,We gotta give 'em a good scare\Nto get more tourists out here!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:53.00,0:11:54.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:55.58,0:11:57.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Look, Sensei, a spirit!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:57.46,0:11:58.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go easy on her, guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Go easy on her, guys.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:58.96,0:12:00.25,Q1,,0,0,0,,Gotta catch 'em all!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:00.25,0:12:01.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:01.29,0:12:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:04.92,0:12:09.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I wish I could've been with Senpai.\NI totally drew the wrong straw.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:09.75,0:12:13.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nonoa looks totally chill.\NIs she not scared of this stuff?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:14.92,0:12:19.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I've got you.\NI can exorcise most low-level spirits.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:19.67,0:12:22.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Whoa... How is she so good at this?
Dialogue: 1,0:12:29.38,0:12:32.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay, that is WAY freakier than a dinky floating soul!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.58,0:12:36.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of those urban legend monsters,\Nlike the kunekune or Hasshaku-sama!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:36.75,0:12:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's too tough for me!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:38.83,0:12:41.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I should ask the high priest what to do next time!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:42.21,0:12:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,This way! Don't let them see you!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:44.96,0:12:45.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,This way!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:46.21,0:12:47.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Definitely not this way!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:49.54,0:12:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Still nothing?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:51.29,0:12:52.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,How?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:53.00,0:12:56.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you, Okumura?!\NHow are you not scared?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:56.38,0:12:58.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Do you just not believe in ghosts?!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:58.42,0:13:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh? No, ghosts totally exist.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:01.50,0:13:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why would I be scared of\Nsomething I know is there?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:03.92,0:13:04.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:05.13,0:13:09.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,True otaku are always ready\Nfor the supernatural to appear!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:09.96,0:13:14.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've practiced using superpowers in my mind,\Njust in case they ever awaken in me.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:14.75,0:13:18.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm always prepared to receive a\Nghostly visitor and their spiritual assistance!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:19.92,0:13:21.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Otaku are crazy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:23.75,0:13:25.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,You okay, Aria?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:25.92,0:13:28.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't move. My legs are like jelly.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.92,0:13:31.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Want me to carry you on my back,\Nor like a princess?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:31.79,0:13:32.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:13:33.29,0:13:37.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Y-you're kidding, right?\NYou know I'm heavier than most girls.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:38.08,0:13:41.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,A-and I'm hardly a princess, so...
Dialogue: 1,0:13:45.25,0:13:46.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, God.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:47.67,0:13:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,I know this feeling.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:50.58,0:13:52.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't deny it anymore.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:53.88,0:13:55.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've got a crush on him.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:57.63,0:13:59.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's wait here for everyone to catch up.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.58,0:14:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:00.92,0:14:04.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, I bet the girls love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:04.96,0:14:05.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:06.33,0:14:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're single, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:07.92,0:14:09.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're not dating Ririsa, or Mikarin?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:10.00,0:14:11.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:12.13,0:14:14.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,There aren't any girls you'd wanna date?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:15.17,0:14:17.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nah, I don't do 3D girls.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:17.54,0:14:18.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, never?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:24.17,0:14:25.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 1,0:14:25.88,0:14:28.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,I liked 3D girls when I was little.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:29.33,0:14:31.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,There was one girl I liked, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:31.42,0:14:32.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, whoa.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:32.38,0:14:37.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, then my mom hooked up with a\Nrandom guy and left me all on my own.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:37.79,0:14:41.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's when I stopped trusting people.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:41.67,0:14:45.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,If they're just gonna betray me,\Nwhy bother with them in the first place?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:45.75,0:14:48.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,No one thinks much of me, anyways.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:48.79,0:14:52.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Life's easier when you don't care about opinions.
Dialogue: 1,0:14:53.17,0:14:55.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Isn't that hard, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:14:56.63,0:14:59.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not when I have the 2D world.\NIt makes life worth living.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:00.50,0:15:03.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's probably saved my life\Na hundred times without me realizing it.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:04.38,0:15:08.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel would never betray me.\NShe's always been there.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:08.96,0:15:10.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,But I guess lately, I'd say...
Dialogue: 1,0:15:14.13,0:15:15.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, are you crying for me?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:15.83,0:15:18.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,There are people who deal\Nwith way worse than that!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:19.25,0:15:23.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That doesn't mean your situation sucks any less!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:23.00,0:15:28.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Everyone's lives are a mix of\Nhappy moments and sad moments.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.54,0:15:33.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,We've all lived through sad moments,\Nso I know how much it must've hurt for you!
Dialogue: 1,0:15:35.58,0:15:36.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,That must have been so hard.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:38.00,0:15:38.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:41.79,0:15:43.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okumura, you're crying.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:43.38,0:15:44.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am?
Dialogue: 1,0:15:44.96,0:15:47.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,I guess no one's ever said that to me before.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to feel.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:51.25,0:15:52.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okumura.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:54.13,0:15:58.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,I would never betray the man I loved.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:00.67,0:16:05.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know you're not that kind of person, Aria.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:06.17,0:16:09.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Lately, I've started to think\Nthat girls like that could exist.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:10.13,0:16:11.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You do, so they must.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:13.79,0:16:14.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:15.63,0:16:16.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:17.00,0:16:19.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, you guys okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:20.67,0:16:23.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Aww, you guys were behind everything?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:23.63,0:16:25.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:25.67,0:16:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,That was great.\NThat big one was really scary!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:29.29,0:16:31.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,The wriggly one that was like, three meters tall?
Dialogue: 1,0:16:33.29,0:16:35.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,That wasn't ours.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:37.42,0:16:39.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's time for the photoshoot.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:40.08,0:16:43.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,I want to help Ririsa achieve her\Ndream and make an awesome cosrom...
Dialogue: 1,0:16:43.08,0:16:47.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not just because I promised her,\Nbut because I genuinely want to help.
Dialogue: 1,0:16:48.67,0:16:53.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her cosplay is already perfect.\NThe rest is up to me!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:54.13,0:16:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:57.46,0:16:58.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.08,0:16:58.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's do this!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:58.08,0:16:58.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 1,0:16:59.46,0:17:02.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Let's get started!\NEyes on the camera, everyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.88,0:17:09.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Liliel, can you come take a look?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:09.17,0:17:10.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sure, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:10.67,0:17:12.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,I think they look good, but...
Dialogue: 1,0:17:12.58,0:17:13.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,They're so good!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:13.79,0:17:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,The lighting is harsh, but it works,\Nconsidering the location.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:18.71,0:17:22.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,What is it, Liliel?\NWhat do you need me to change?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:22.33,0:17:24.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, nothing, Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:24.79,0:17:27.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,The composition, the timing,\Neverything looks just like the manga!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:27.92,0:17:29.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,You can be honest, you know.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:29.67,0:17:32.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I am! I don't see anything that needs fixing.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:32.46,0:17:36.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're already doing the best we can.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:37.13,0:17:38.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 1,0:17:39.08,0:17:43.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,We're doing our best,\Nbut I haven't done better yet!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:43.63,0:17:46.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,I have to stop thinking\Nof Liliel as a figurine,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:46.13,0:17:48.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,or I won't be able to\Ncapture the real, live Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:48.83,0:17:51.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I need to tear down this mental wall,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:51.33,0:17:53.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,and capture the real, live Liliel in front of me!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:54.00,0:17:55.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Not the 2D, not the 3D,
Dialogue: 1,0:17:55.88,0:17:58.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,but the 2.5D Liliel!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:59.33,0:18:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Think, dammit! Liliel is your waifu!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:02.25,0:18:04.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,You're taking photos of your darling wife!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:05.50,0:18:06.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's not working!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:06.17,0:18:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,I can't imagine a world where\NI can actually touch my waifu!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:09.63,0:18:13.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, why is Senpai only taking pictures of Liliel?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:14.71,0:18:16.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Why won't you look at me?!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,How's your homework coming along?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:26.50,0:18:28.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Looks about the same to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:28.83,0:18:29.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:30.54,0:18:32.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This one of Miriella is good.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:32.42,0:18:34.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,She feels like a real, live person.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:34.50,0:18:36.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,Really?! How, though?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:37.33,0:18:38.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,Try figuring it out on your own.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.75,0:18:41.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,You won't be able to do this again until you do.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.38,0:18:43.17,Q0,,0,0,0,,Um..
Dialogue: 1,0:18:43.58,0:18:46.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Her face looks pretty?
Dialogue: 1,0:18:46.33,0:18:48.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's deeper than that, bozo.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:48.00,0:18:51.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,But, at least you can\Nrecognize that she looks pretty.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:51.71,0:18:52.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,I always could.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:52.96,0:18:57.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,I mean, you don't have to be crazy\Nabout flowers to know they're pretty.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:57.25,0:19:01.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari has always been pretty.\NI thought she was pretty the day we met.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:02.08,0:19:02.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:03.54,0:19:06.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,He'd already given up on\Nreal women around then, huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:07.46,0:19:08.75,Q0,,0,0,0,,This is tricky.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:08.75,0:19:13.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Something about that hang-up is\Nstifling his skill as a photographer.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:14.04,0:19:20.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,If we could get that figured out on this trip,\Nit might help him grow as a person, too.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:21.88,0:19:26.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,When I saw Miriella in that moment,\NI felt something inside.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:26.75,0:19:29.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what was it?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:30.46,0:19:32.88,Q0,,0,0,0,,And back then, and that moment, too...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:33.29,0:19:35.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,But what? And why?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:40.33,0:19:44.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, Okumura's dying on us.\NLet's take a break.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:44.50,0:19:45.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:47.75,0:19:49.29,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai, you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:49.67,0:19:52.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Miriella.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:52.04,0:19:54.67,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wow, you really are out of it.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:56.92,0:20:00.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's it actually like to have a wife?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:00.71,0:20:02.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, you want to get married already?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:02.79,0:20:06.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,No, I'm just trying something for the shoot.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:06.42,0:20:07.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Oh, huh.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:07.54,0:20:11.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,Like, what would it be like\Nto take pictures of my wife?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:11.88,0:20:13.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Maybe it'd feel something like this?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:13.96,0:20:19.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,She's cute, always there for you,\Nand you feel totally relaxed with her.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:19.67,0:20:21.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 1,0:20:21.04,0:20:25.46,Q0,,0,0,0,,I get nervous around Liliel, but right now,\NI feel weirdly calm and relaxed.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:26.21,0:20:31.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is it because the person in the\Ncosplay is my childhood friend?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.21,0:20:42.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Hey, sleepyhead.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:42.67,0:20:44.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,How long was I out?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:44.08,0:20:45.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,About two hours.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:45.42,0:20:46.08,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:46.08,0:20:48.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's fine. Everyone's having fun outside.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:49.00,0:20:51.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Wait, were you here the whole two hours?
Dialogue: 1,0:20:51.71,0:20:53.71,Q0,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you looked cute.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:54.13,0:20:54.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:55.17,0:20:58.54,Q0,,0,0,0,,Don't apologize.\NI can hold out for two hours.
Dialogue: 1,0:20:59.29,0:21:01.50,Q0,,0,0,0,,I've held out for ten years already.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:01.50,0:21:02.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:05.29,0:21:06.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:07.79,0:21:13.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,For a second, I saw Mikari inside of Miriella.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:14.08,0:21:15.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:15.00,0:21:18.42,Q0,,0,0,0,,This 2D angel didn't come\Ndown from heaven on her own!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:18.92,0:21:20.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari brought her down to earth!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:21.33,0:21:22.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's the cosplayer!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:23.04,0:21:24.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:24.63,0:21:26.96,Q0,,0,0,0,,You have to hear what Aria-chan told us!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.08,0:21:27.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,She... She saw a sea cucumber and...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.63,0:21:29.79,Q0,,0,0,0,,She... She saw a sea cucumber and...
Dialogue: 1,0:21:27.63,0:21:29.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Guys! You promised you wouldn't tell anyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:29.79,0:21:30.79,Q1,,0,0,0,,Guys! You promised you wouldn't tell anyone!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:32.42,0:21:33.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Now you have to tell us.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:35.46,0:21:40.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai... When did you start\Nlooking at other girls like that?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:45.00,0:21:47.13,Q0,,0,0,0,,He's never looked at me like that.
Dialogue: 1,0:21:49.75,0:21:50.83,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:53.46,0:21:54.63,Q0,,0,0,0,,Is she crying?
Dialogue: 1,0:21:57.79,0:22:02.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,Senpai lights up every time Ririsa enters the room.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:03.17,0:22:05.00,Q0,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time now.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:05.79,0:22:07.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,Mikari-chan, are you okay?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:10.25,0:22:11.25,Q0,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:11.58,0:22:12.21,Q0,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:22:12.21,0:22:13.38,Q0,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:13.38,0:22:15.04,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm your friend,\NI can't let you cry out here alone!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.04,0:22:16.58,Q0,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:17.04,0:22:17.92,Q0,,0,0,0,,I love him!
Dialogue: 1,0:22:20.13,0:22:24.33,Q0,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with Senpai.
